#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#   Name            : shareorddp001.scr
#   Description     : This script is used to check weither input account is belongs to particular bacid.
#   Date            : 19-02-2013
#   Author          : Prakash
#   Input           : BANCS.INPUT.acctid
#   Outpu           : status
#   Called jsp      : tmdet_custom.jsp
